cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its design and circuit research, please cite it as below."
title: "Faust Pedal Kit"
abstract: >-
  A workshop for designing new guitar and bass effects in Faust, built as
  native Linux LV2 and VST3 plugins, with offline measurement tests. It
  includes clean-room models of classic pedals, with documented circuit
  research, as a source of building blocks for original designs.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Heffer
    given-names: Joe
# A single SPDX identifier: Zenodo rejects a list here. Documentation under
